1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,019
Speaking, task four. Situation number 7. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:18,086
On Sunday we want to go on a trip with the children. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,321
We could go to the zoo.

4
00:00:28,633 --> 00:00:30,344
We went to the zoo last month.

5
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:31,894
Then let's go to a castle.

6
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,912
The castle is far away and the children will be tired.

7
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,844
Then let's go to the water park.

8
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:38,650
And why do you want to go there?

9
00:00:38,933 --> 00:00:42,187
Because the children love swimming and they won't be bored at the water park.

10
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,762
You're right. Let's go to the water park.

11
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:54,354
Practise situation 7 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
